       <h3 class="subheading">Material limitations</h3>
       <p class="small">No local mycologist or medical toxicologist reviewed this candidate. Species coverage is intentionally incomplete. Morphology changes with age, damage, weather, and region. Clinical latency ranges overlap and cannot diagnose a toxin. The app study tested three products on 78 Australian exposure specimens; it supports an app-alone warning, not a permanent ranking of all identification tools.</p>
